{"resourceIdentifier":"5138","resourceName":"Wuhan Jiangxia Changshankou LFG Power Project Phase II","description":"Wuhan Jiangxia Changshankou LFG Power Project Phase II (hereafter referred to as “the Project”) is a landfill gas (LFG) recovery and utilization project ocated at Changshankou Landfill, Jinkou Street, Jiangxia District, Wuhan City, Hubei province, People’s Republic of China.\r\nThe purpose of the Project is to collect LFG from Changshankou Landfill and utilize it for power generation. It includes LFG collection system, LFG pre-treatment system, flaring and electricity generation system. LFG collected will be used for electricity generation with internal combustion generators.\r\nThe Project achieves emission reductions in two aspects: 1) it avoids methane emissions by capturing and destroying LFG which would have been directly vented into the atmosphere in the baseline scenario; 2) it reduces CO2 emissions by displacing part of the electricity that would otherwise have been supplied by CCPG.","location":{"latitude":30.352778,"longitude":114.209167},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-06-24","endExclusive":"2024-07-25","endInclusive":"2024-07-24"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5138"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hubei"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Wuhan Huantou Environmental Technology Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Hubei Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"5138"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"157260"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"c